  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GIF Growth-Technical Assistance Facility(TAF): Scaling high impact innovations in emerging markets through innovative financing and technical assistance support (2025-2029/USD 1,678,328)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provisioning of debt and mezzanine capital to innovative and impactful SMEs, provisioning of Technical Assistance and portfolio management support. This facility will complement GIF approach to additionality in our investing by minimising risks, maximising opportunities and de risking innovations to attract funding for scale.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Technical Assistance aims to do this by supporting our investees in compliance with enhanced Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) standards, gender gap assessments, impact evaluations, customer understanding and product design, and climate adaptation quantification.&#xc544;&#xc2dc;&#xc544; &#xbc0f; &#xc544;&#xd504;&#xb9ac;&#xce74; &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed; &#xc911;&#xc18c;&#xae30;&#xc5c5; &#xc784;&#xd329;&#xd2b8; &#xcc3d;&#xcd9c;, &#xc77c;&#xc790;&#xb9ac; &#xcc3d;&#xcd9c;,  &#xae30;&#xd6c4; &#xd68c;&#xbcf5;&#xb825;&#xc744; &#xb192;&#xc774;&#xb294; &#xae30;&#xc220;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xc77c;$5 &#xbbf8;&#xb9cc; &#xc800;&#xc18c;&#xb4dd;&#xce35; &#xac10;&#xc18c; &#xb4f1;</narrative>
  </description>
